Subject: [PATCH 29/69] ARM: dts: iwg22m: Add watchdog support to SoM dtsi
Date: Fri, 18 May 2018 13:17:02 +0200
Message-Id: <a8e2c377fe2483f7fcd5746ab4e0c43c3262c1de.1526641667.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
